  "about.bio.1": "I'm Voikyrioh: a fullstack developer passionate about creation. I love technical challenges and building things with my own hands, which is what led me to become a developer.",
  "about.bio.2": "As a web developer by trade, I love the rigour the backend demands and the creativity and visualisation that frontend brings. My love of video games and fantasy worlds led me to explore 3D graphics programming and Unity (and C#) in my personal projects.",
